  "notable_quotes": [
    "Zeolite transport and separation design should match molecular kinetic diameter to pore opening size or freely diffusing sphere diameter Df.",
    "Simple size exclusion is insufficient: p-xylene diffuses effectively in MFI even though its kinetic diameter exceeds 5.70 Å and MFI Df is only about 4.70 Å.",
    "Diffusion in zeolites is controlled jointly by framework topology, guest conformation, acid-site interactions, loading, and temperature rather than pore size alone."
